# Eye for an Eye (CR 614.1a, 611.2a): "this turn". Bot1 casts it on its own turn 3 and chooses Bot2's Fencing Ace, which deals no
# damage that turn. The effect ends with the turn, so on turn 4 the Ace's double strike is dealt to Bot1 in full (2): Bot1 16 after its own Shock,
# Bot2 untouched at 20, and nothing was prevented.

